1993</year><volume>259</volume><fpage>1421</fpage><lpage>1425</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8383878</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gerton</surname><given-names>GL</given-names></name><name><surname>Hedrick</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The coelomic envelope to vitelline envelope conversion in eggs of <italic>Xenopus laevis. </italic></article-title><source>J Cell Biochem</source><year>1986a</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>341</fpage><lpage>350</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3711153</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gerton</surname><given-names>GL</given-names></name><name><surname>Hedrick</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The vitelline envelope to fertilization  envelope conversion in eggs of <italic>Xenopus laevis. </italic></article-title><source>Dev Biol</source><year>1986b</year><volume>11</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3089852</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Grey</surname><given-names>RD</given-names></name><name><surname>Bastiani</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Webb</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Schertel</surname><given-names>ER</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>An electrical  block is required to prevent polyspermy in eggs fertilized by natural mating  of <italic>Xenopus laevis. </italic></article-title><source>Dev Biol</source><year>1982</year><volume>89</volume><fpage>475</fpage><lpage>484</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7056442</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Grey</surname><g